---------------+-------------+--------------------------+--------+--------------------+----------------------------+-------------------------
  sparse_table | ts          | timestamp with time zone | NO     | TIMESTAMPTZ(3)     |                       NULL |                   NULL
  sparse_table | value       | integer                  | NO     | INT4               |                         32 |                      0
  sparse_table | host        | character varying        | YES    | VARCHAR(20)        |                       NULL |                   NULL
  ts_table     | ts          | timestamp with time zone | NO     | TIMESTAMPTZ(3)     |                       NULL |                   NULL
  ts_table     | value       | integer                  | NO     | INT4               |                         32 |                      0
  ts_table     | host        | character varying        | YES    | VARCHAR(20)        |                       NULL |                   NULL
